---
const {project,cards=[],families=[],visual=false}=Astro.props;
const connections=project.settings?.deck_blueprint_v1?.connections??[];
const board=project.settings?.visual_design_v1;
const cardName=(id:string)=>cards.find((c:any)=>c.id===id)?.title??'Unavailable card';
---
<div data-living-collection>
<nav class="collection-tabs" aria-label={visual?'Visual collection views':'Living collection views'}>{['cards','themes','progress'].map((view,i)=><button type="button" data-collection-view={view} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{view[0].toUpperCase()+view.slice(1)}</button>)}</nav>
<section data-collection-panel="cards"><p>One living collection. Open a card to work with its writing and artwork together.</p><label class="studio-field">Find a card<input type="search" data-collection-search placeholder="Title, number or family"/></label><div class="living-card-grid">{cards.map((card:any,i:number)=><article data-living-card data-collection-card={card.id} data-search={`${card.title} ${card.card_number} ${families.find((f:any)=>f.id===card.family_id)?.name??''}`.toLocaleLowerCase()}><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/cards/${card.id}/` }><div data-collection-art>{typeof board?.cards?.[card.id]?.front==='string'&&board.cards[card.id].front.startsWith('data:image/jpeg;base64,')?<img src={board.cards[card.id].front} alt={`Working artwork preview for ${card.title}`}/>:<span class="artwork-empty">Add artwork</span>}</div><small>{card.card_number||'Unnumbered'}</small><h3>{card.title}</h3><p>{families.find((f:any)=>f.id===card.family_id)?.name??'No family assigned'}</p></a></article>)}</div>{!cards.length?<p>Your collection can begin with a single idea. <a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/cards/new/`}>Add a card in The Expression</a>.</p>:null}</section>
<section data-collection-panel="themes" hidden><h3>Patterns you have already named</h3><p>These are your current families and creator-described connections. No automated interpretation or merging is applied.</p>{families.map((family:any)=><details><summary>{family.name}</summary><ul>{cards.filter((c:any)=>c.family_id===family.id).map((c:any)=><li><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/cards/${c.id}/`}>{c.title}</a></li>)}</ul></details>)}{connections.map((link:any)=><p><strong>{cardName(link.from)} → {cardName(link.to)}</strong><br/>{link.relationship}</p>)}{!families.length&&!connections.length?<p>No families or additional connections have been named. An open collection is valid too.</p>:null}<a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/journey/?chapter=architecture`}>Explore relationships in The Architecture</a></section>
<section data-collection-panel="progress" hidden><h3>The work as it stands</h3><p>These are the statuses you assign while developing your cards, not quality grades. Artwork approval and print readiness are different decisions.</p><ul>{cards.map((c:any)=><li data-progress-card={c.id}><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/cards/${c.id}/`}>{c.title}</a> — <span data-progress-label>{c.status??'outline'}</span></li>)}</ul><p>No card must be finished before you explore the next chapter.</p></section>
</div>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-living-collection]').forEach(root=>{root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-collection-view]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-collection-panel]').forEach(panel=>panel.hidden=panel.dataset.collectionPanel!==button.dataset.collectionView);root.querySelectorAll('[data-collection-view]').forEach(tab=>tab.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(tab===button)))}));root.querySelector('[data-collection-search]')?.addEventListener('input',event=>{const value=(event.target as HTMLInputElement).value.toLocaleLowerCase();root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-living-card]').forEach(card=>card.hidden=!card.dataset.search!.includes(value))})});</script>
<style>.collection-tabs{display:flex;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1.3rem 0}.collection-tabs button{background:none;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding:.6rem .35rem;font:inherit;color:inherit}.collection-tabs button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#8a6a1f;font-weight:700}.living-card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.living-card-grid article{background:white;border:1px solid #cec9c1;padding:.7rem;min-width:0}.living-card-grid a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.living-card-grid svg,.living-card-grid img{width:100%;height:170px;object-fit:contain}.living-card-grid h3{font:600 1rem/1.4 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:.45rem 0}.living-card-grid p{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5}.living-card-grid small,.collection-small{font-size:.8rem;color:#58605d}[data-living-collection] p{line-height:1.7}[data-living-collection] input{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:.8rem;box-sizing:border-box;background:white;border:1px solid #9d9e94;border-radius:4px}[data-living-collection] .studio-field{display:grid;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0}[data-living-collection] details{padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1}[data-living-collection] summary{cursor:pointer}[data-living-collection] :is(button,a):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #065e73;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.living-card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.living-card-grid img,.living-card-grid svg{height:145px}}</style>
